    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a work simulation game with a slightly scary atmosphere and loop elements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a dormitory manager and your job is to inspect all the dormitories from the 1st to the 10th floor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's at least one violation of dorm rules on every floor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sound of your footsteps, the sound of the door opening, and the light of your flashlight may cause these dorm violations to hide</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, you need to move slowly if necessary, or turn off the flashlight, and after observing the type of violation, give them the necessary persuasion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you think you've dealt with all the violations, go upstairs. Repeat until you reach the tenth floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Visual sense of high school dormitory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Randomly generated replay experience.</p>",
